    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12547776/comment/13236526",
          "id": "13236526",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "patch against 3x... i plan to just port forward to trunk.\n\nThe problem was that java7's default table style has width:100%, so we need to explicitly set it to auto for these captions.\n\nAdditionally we need to ensure the text is actually centered for formulas where we have A/B.\n\nThis changes nothing for java5/6 but fixes the issue for java7.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2012-03-23T11:47:16.212+0000",
          "updated": "2012-03-23T11:47:16.212+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12547776/comment/13236527",
          "id": "13236527",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=steffkes",
            "name": "steffkes",
            "key": "steffkes",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Matheis",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "I just had quick look .. in [stylesheet.css|http://people.apache.org/~rmuir/java7-style-javadocs/stylesheet.css] on line #345 is a declaration for\n{code}.contentContainer ul li table, .classUseContainer ul li table, .constantValuesContainer ul li table {\n    width:100%;\n}{code}\nwhich expands the table. the fix would be to remove this, but i don't know if there are tables which requires this?\n\nIn the attached Screenshot, i've modified the Source w/ Chrome Dev-Tools and set {{width: auto}} (see at the right bottom) and it's no longer expanded.\n\nDoes this help?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=steffkes",
            "name": "steffkes",
            "key": "steffkes",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steffkes&avatarId=10183"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Matheis",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "created": "2012-03-23T11:47:36.493+0000",
          "updated": "2012-03-23T11:47:36.493+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12547776/comment/13236530",
          "id": "13236530",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
